<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3646/51 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6907/12 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9001/06 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4020/30 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.90/91  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.6990/10   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1665.2/5.5  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.80/90   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.5071/45   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0388/60   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4395/15   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6567/78</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$342.60/10</p>
</text>
